# Variables passed to the eval sandbox, where the LTC checks of every project run.
# Copy to docker/eval.env (git-ignored) and recreate the stack: ./rebuild.sh
#
# Use them for what a project's tests declare in the LTC "environment" section, e.g. a real
# test database. From the sandbox, the Mac host is host.containers.internal.
# Names containing TOKEN, SECRET, PASSWORD, API_KEY, CREDENTIAL... are refused: the sandbox
# never holds credentials. Use a disposable database with local trust auth.
#
# LEADINTEL_TEST_DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg://me@host.containers.internal:5432/leadintel_test
